OL,3,GNEWSAPigeon care group helps birds with
OL,4,Astringfoot
OL,5,
OL,6,FA group has formed in East Kent to help
OL,7,Fpigeons suffering from a problem that
OL,8,Fcan irreparably damage their feet.
OL,10,FStringfoot happens to nest-building
OL,11,Fpigeons whose feet have become
OL,12,Fentangled with foreign matter discarded
OL,13,Fby the human population of towns and
OL,14,Fcities.
OL,16,FCanterbury and Thanet Stringfoot
OL,17,FPigeons recently started to help
OL,18,Faffected pigeons by destringing them
OL,19,Fhumanely.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
