OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPigeon care group helps birds with
OL,4,Astringfoot
OL,5,
OL,6,FFounder Philippa Taylor explains that
OL,7,Fdiscarded string, thread, hair and hair
OL,8,Fextensions "gets wrapped around pigeons
OL,9,Ffeet and causes great pain, their toes
OL,10,Fstart to die and then sometimes fall
OL,11,Foff - it's a horrible condition."
